# .NET build output.
#
# Scoped here rather than added to the repository root .gitignore on purpose: that file
# belongs to main, and this branch's rule is to stay additive so merges from main keep
# being trivial (see docs/dotnet-migration/README.md). A new file in a new directory
# cannot conflict; an edit to the root ignore list can.
#
# The qmake side (release/, Makefile.*, .qmake.stash, *.log) is already covered by the
# root .gitignore, so only the .NET artifacts need listing.

bin/
obj/
